				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				739,
				3
			],
			"Message": "feat(Output): Add detailed acquireVsCodeApi return value diagnostics\n\nExtend the `RuntimeDiagnosticsInner` transform plugin in Output to perform a rigorous validation of the `acquireVsCodeApi` interface at the 4-second mark. The new logic explicitly invokes the function and inspects the resulting API object to verify the presence and type of `postMessage`, `getState`, and `setState` methods.\n\nPreviously, diagnostics only confirmed the function's existence and availability. This update captures the full execution result, including error states and method signatures, reporting them via the `VSCODE_API_TEST` event. This granular telemetry is critical for debugging subtle initialization failures where the API object is returned but structurally incomplete, ensuring robust extension host connectivity across WKWebView and Chromium backends.",
			"SHA": "2e0e411fc361d0ea8f77a320c0ef8f480cc68bf1"
		}
	],
